: null, "structure": null, "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": {"22": 0.7166690230369568}, "layout_token_count": 0, "metadata": null, "removed": true, "html": null}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[206.856, 56.232], [402.08400000000006, 56.232], [402.08400000000006, 70.488], [206.856, 70.488]], "bbox": [206.856, 56.232, 402.08400000000006, 70.488]}, "block_description": "The header of a section of text or other blocks.", "block_type": "21", "block_id": 5, "page_id": 0, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "heading_level": 2, "html": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Nighttime Practice for Lucid Dreams</h2>"}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[54.467999999999996, 86.328], [550.1880000000001, 86.328], [550.1880000000001, 130.68], [54.467999999999996, 130.68]], "bbox": [54.467999999999996, 86.328, 550.1880000000001, 130.68]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 6, "page_id": 0, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "has_continuation": false, "blockquote": false, "blockquote_level": 0, "html": "<p>To begin, first schedule which night(s) you can devote at least 8 hours to complete this dream technique. Then Follow the sequence listed below. You can adjust the example times given based on what works for your schedule. If you can go to bed earlier, or sleep in later than can help.</p>"}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[61.2, 138.6], [143.20800000000003, 138.6], [143.20800000000003, 152.06400000000002], [61.2, 152.06400000000002]], "bbox": [61.2, 138.6, 143.20800000000003, 152.06400000000002]}, "block_description": "The header of a section of text or other blocks.", "block_type": "21", "block_id": 7, "page_id": 0, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "heading_level": null, "html": "<p><b>Requirements:</b></p>"}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[61.2, 153.648], [247.24800000000005, 153.648], [247.24800000000005, 196.416], [61.2, 196.416]], "bbox": [61.2, 153.648, 247.24800000000005, 196.416]}, "block_description": "A group of list items that should be rendered together.", "block_type": "6", "block_id": 8, "page_id": 0, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "has_continuation": false, "html": "<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<li>\u2022 Dream journal and pen</li>\n<li>\u2022 2 alarm clocks</li>\n<li>\u2022 At least 8 hours of time in bed.</li>\n</ul>"}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[369.64799999999997, 138.6], [423.5039999999999, 138.6], [423.5039999999999, 152.06400000000002], [369.64799999999997, 152.06400000000002]], "bbox": [369.64799999999997, 138.6, 423.5039999999999, 152.06400000000002]}, "block_description": "The header of a section of text or other blocks.", "block_type": "21", "block_id": 9, "page_id": 0, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "heading_level": null, "html": "<p><b>Optional:</b></p>"}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[369.64799999999997, 152.06400000000002], [523.872, 152.06400000000002], [523.872, 190.07999999999998], [369.64799999999997, 190.07999999999998]], "bbox": [369.64799999999997, 152.06400000000002, 523.872, 190.07999999999998]}, "block_description": "A group of list items that should be rendered together.", "block_type": "6", "block_id": 10, "page_id": 0, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "has_continuation": false, "html": "<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<li>\u2022 Dream Supplement or Tea</li>\n<li>\u2022 Ear Plugs</li>\n<li>\u2022 Blindfold</li>\n</ul>"}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[55.08, 214.63200000000003], [552.024, 214.63200000000003], [552.024, 679.5360000000001], [55.08, 679.5360000000001]], "bbox": [55.08, 214.63200000000003, 552.024, 679.5360000000001]}, "block_description": "A table of data, like a results table.  It will be in a tabular format.", "block_type": "22", "block_id": 11, "page_id": 0, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "html": "<table border=\"1\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>A. Prepare (30 minutes)</b></th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Example</b></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<li>\u2022 Setup 2 alarms: First alarm set for 5 hours from when you start to go to sleep.</li>\n<li>\u2022 Set the second alarm for 8 hours or when you need to get up for your normal day.</li>\n<li>\u2022 Write down your <i>lucid dream intention</i> or what you want to do if you get lucid.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">10:30pm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><b>B. Sleep (5 hours)</b></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<li>\u2022 Start to go to sleep until the first alarm wakes you up (approximately 5 hours)</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">11:00pm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><b>C. Wake Up (Stay away for at least 20 minutes)</b></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<li>\u2022 Get out of bed and stretch. Spend some time reading or writing.</li>\n<li>\u2022 Write down if you remember a dream and read your <i>lucid dream intention</i>.</li>\n<li>\u2022 If you wish; take a dream supplement with a glass of water, or drink dream tea.</li>\n<li>\u2022 <u>Do a reality test</u>, and keep in mind that you will be dreaming soon.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">4:00 am</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><b>D. Sleep and Dream (between 30 minutes and 2 hours)</b></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<li>\u2022 If you are in a place that may get noisy or bright use ear plugs and a blindfold.</li>\n<li>\u2022 Relax, let go, and lay still. Sometimes it can take a little while to fall back asleep.</li>\n<li>\u2022 Quiet your mind and don't talk to yourself, Just be patient.</li>\n<li>\u2022 If you find yourself in a dream, rub your hands together to stabilize it</li>\n<li>\u2022 try to do your lucid dream intention, then purposefully wake up to get clear recall.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">4:30 am</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><b>E. Recall Dream</b></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<li>\u2022 Lay back in the same position you woke up in and close your eyes.</li>\n<li>\u2022 Quiet your mind, and allow yourself to recall as much as you can.</li>\n<li>\u2022 Spend 2 minutes recalling, then get up and write in your dream journal.</li>\n<li>\u2022 Always write a title and a date, even if you don't remember much.</li>\n<li>\u2022 Go back to bed if there is more time to sleep.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">6:00 am</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><b>F. Get Up</b></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<li>\u2022 Share your dream experience with someone this morning.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">7:00 am</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[54.467999999999996, 693.0], [401.47200000000004, 693.0], [401.47200000000004, 719.928], [54.467999999999996, 719.928]], "bbox": [54.467999999999996, 693.0, 401.47200000000004, 719.928]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 12, "page_id": 0, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": true, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "removed": false, "has_continuation": false, "blockquote": false, "blockquote_level": 0, "html": "<p><b>Optional:</b> Send me your feedback, questions, or dream experience:<br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.YouCanLucidDream.com/contact\">www.YouCanLucidDream.com/contact</a> or <a href=\"mailto:Richard@BulbMedia.com\">Richard@BulbMedia.com</a></p>"}], "excluded_block_types": ["1", "2"], "maximum_assignment_distance": 20, "refs": [], "ocr_errors_detected": false, "pdftext_page": null, "current_children": [{"polygon": {"polygon": [[206.856, 56.232], [402.08400000000006, 56.232], [402.08400000000006, 70.488], [206.856, 70.488]], "bbox": [206.856, 56.232, 402.08400000000006, 70.488]}, "block_description": "The header of a section of text or other blocks.", "block_type": "21", "block_id": 5, "page_id": 0, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "lowres_image": null, "highres_image": null, "removed": false}, {"polygon": {"polygon": [[54.467999999999996, 86.328], [550.1880000000001, 86.328], [550.1880000000001, 130.68], [54.467999999999996, 130.68]], "bbox": [54.467999999999996, 86.328, 550.1880000000001, 130.68]}, "block_description": "A paragraph or line of text.", "block_type": "23", "block_id": 6, "page_id": 0, "text_extraction_method": "surya", "structure": [], "ignore_for_output": false, "replace_output_newlines": false, "source": "layout", "top_k": null, "layout_token_count": null, "metadata": null, "lowres_